@startuml
title MedNexus AI - PubMed Research Search

actor User
participant "React Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Node.js / Express" as Backend
participant "PubMed E-utilities" as PubMed

User -> Frontend : Enter research query
Frontend -> Backend : Send search request
Backend -> PubMed : Search publications (ESearch)
PubMed --> Backend : Return publication IDs

Backend -> PubMed : Retrieve publication details (ESummary)
PubMed --> Backend : Return metadata

Backend -> PubMed : Retrieve abstract (EFetch)
PubMed --> Backend : Return abstract if available

Backend --> Frontend : Return research results
Frontend --> User : Display publications and abstracts

@enduml
